          },
          {
            "id": "p33",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Titanium tetraiodide (\\(\\text{TiI}_4\\)) is volatile. Its vapour is passed over a hot tungsten filament, where it decomposes:",
